<title>AUSTRIA: Vienna bourse says extends trading to 1400 GMT.</title>
<headline>Vienna bourse says extends trading to 1400 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Vienna bourse said on Monday share trading would be extended by one hour to 1400 GMT (1500 local) after trading was suspended for about 40 minutes because of technical problems with the EQOS trading system. -- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
